---
// Frequently Asked Questions in pure Vercel light design style
---

<section id="faq" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-[#ebebeb] bg-[#fafafa]">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="eyebrow text-[#0070f3] block mb-2">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717]">
        Common questions.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details class="group vercel-card rounded-xl p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] shadow-xs">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-medium text-sm text-[#171717]">
          <span>Is it really free?</span>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#8f8f8f] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#4d4d4d] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Yes. There are no subscriptions, credits, or hidden fees. Use it as much as you like.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details class="group vercel-card rounded-xl p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] shadow-xs">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-medium text-sm text-[#171717]">
          <span>Is my data private?</span>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#8f8f8f] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#4d4d4d] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Yes. Your text, voice recordings, and generated audio are never saved, stored, or shared.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details class="group vercel-card rounded-xl p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] shadow-xs">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-medium text-sm text-[#171717]">
          <span>Can I download the audio?</span>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#8f8f8f] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#4d4d4d] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Yes. Once your speech is ready, you can listen to it and download the audio file with one click.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details class="group vercel-card rounded-xl p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] shadow-xs">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-medium text-sm text-[#171717]">
          <span>How does voice cloning work?</span>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#8f8f8f] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#4d4d4d] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Record or upload a 5 to 15 second audio clip. Speak clearly in a quiet room for the best result.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <details class="group vercel-card rounded-xl p-5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden cursor-pointer bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] shadow-xs">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-medium text-sm text-[#171717]">
          <span>What are the rules for cloning a voice?</span>
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 text-[#8f8f8f] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#4d4d4d] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          You must have permission from the person whose voice you use. Do not use this tool to impersonate or mislead anyone.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
